Two time fields, the "Access Time" and the "Modification Time" are used to change the access and/or modification time of the file. Each time field has two sub fields, the first is for the date and the second is for the time. You enter the date in the date field in the format "mm/dd/yy" and the time in the time field in the format "hh:mm" to change Access and/or Modification time(s). If you change the Modificatio time then the Access Time will also change to the new value. To set Modification/Access time(s) to current time, simply erase the time field(s) and the new time will be the current time. Click SELECT on the "Apply" button to effect the change.  You reset the previously applied values by clicking SELECT on the "Reset" button.
